  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『え～、おほん！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『皆さ～ん！　お怪我のないようにだけ気をつけて、『雪祭り』を楽しんでくださいね～♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『あらためて！　生徒会主催の突発イベント、『雪祭り』のルールを説明いたしましょう！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『個人、あるいは仲良しどうし気のあうものどうしで集団をつくって……。』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『それぞれで雪かき、および雪像の製作をいたします！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『最終的に、製作された雪像を我が校が誇る天才芸術家、冴木ももが独断と偏見で評価し採点します！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『最優秀賞、および上位入賞を果たせば豪華景品を獲得できますので、ふるってご参加くださいね～♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『参加賞も多数、用意しております！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『後ほど炊きだしも行いますので、ご昼食をお持ちでないかたもご安心ください～♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『また雪像の材料を雪かきで集めることで、貢献度に応じてご褒美をゲットできちゃいます！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『雪像なんかつくれないよ、不器用だから、みたいなひともご安心ください！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『雪かきをするだけで、みんなと一緒に『雪祭り』を楽しむことが可能です～♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『以上です、お騒がせいたしました！　生徒会会計、悠木ともこでした！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "『疑問点などがございましたら、生徒会仮設テントのほうまでご一報くださいませ～♪』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「……ふうっ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「この寒いのに大声を張りあげたせいか、喉が『いがいが』しますね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「会長はなぜいつも、あんなにテンションＭＡＸで大騒ぎできるのでしょう……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ともあれ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「転校生さんの『雪祭り』というアイディアのおかげで、皆さん楽しんで参加してくれているようですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「単純に雪かきをするだけでは、ただの『めんどくさい作業』ですしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「誰も好んでしたがりません、わたしの考えが浅はかでした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「けれど、雪像づくりという『楽しみ』と、景品などの『ご褒美』を設定することで……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ただの労働が、すてきな馬鹿騒ぎに早変わり♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「感服いたしました。ほんとうに、あのアホの会長の『やりくち』そのものです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「あのひとの理想を、手法を、意志を、あなたは受け継いでいるのですね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「何でもお祭り騒ぎにしてしまう、これぞ君咲学院生徒会です……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「あなたがいれば、会長が卒業しても……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「来年度の生徒会も、安泰ですね。わたしなんか、必要ないぐらい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「……おや。顔色が優れませんね、転校生さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「もっと誇るべきですよ、あなたは会長のように『たいしたこと』をしたのですから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「すくなくとも、わたしはとっても感謝しております」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「光明が見えた、気がしています。ちょっと不安だったのですよ、これでも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「会長が必死になって築きあげた、みんなが笑顔で青春を満喫できる君咲学院を……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「わたしが、台無しにしてしまうのではないかと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「わたしは意固地で、頑迷です。どう引っくり返っても、会長のようにはなれません」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「できればずっと、会長が思いつきで口にする馬鹿なことに……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「お小言を垂れつつも補佐し支える、それだけの『わたし』でいたかったのですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「どうしようもなく、時計の針は回る。会長も、みつる先輩も、双子も……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「みんな、もうじき卒業してしまう。寂しくて、不安でした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「『そこから先の君咲学院』を、どうすればいいのか……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ずっと考えていました、けれど答えは見いだせませんでした。焦って、悩んで、迷子になったみたいでした」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「けれど。ほんのすこしだけ、わたしは『ほっ』としたのです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「それだけ、あなたに伝えておきましょう。ありがとうございます、転校生さん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「できれば来年も、ずっとずっと……。わたしの、そばにいてください」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「わたしの刀として、道しるべとして、かけがえのない『あなた』として」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「えへへ、プロポーズみたいですね……♪」"
  },
